      "content": "that's a good start. i want to get more specific though. for the first big topic, i want to dive into why the media just ignores certain things, like how much the cost of living is actually ruining families while the news just focuses on whatever political drama they want to push. can u write a segment where the host explains how the mainstream media acts like a mouthpiece for the establishment to keep people distracted?",
